       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KINO-SNR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KINO-SNR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DIFFRACT-EFF-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HARMONIC-SNR-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CROSSTALK-REJECT-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KSNR-LATENCY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KSNR-SEAL-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-KINO-SNR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PKN-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PKN-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EFF-AND-SNR.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CROSSTALK-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKN-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EFF-AND-SNR.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIFFRACT-EFF-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HARMONIC-SNR-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CROSSTALK-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSSTALK-REJECT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KSNR-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKN-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DIFFRACT-EFF-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HARMONIC-SNR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CROSSTALK-REJECT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KSNR-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-KSNR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PKN-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PKN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PKN-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PKN-CODE.
